Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Oh no! That town is being attacked by
monsters! We have to do something!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "The enemies are coming from the Forsaken
Fortress. I bet their leader is in there.",
  "1.0.2.0" => "There's a weird boulder in the way.
We've got to find a way to break it!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "One of the town's keeps got taken!
We can't let that happen!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "We'll take care of any monsters we come across
while looking for something to break that boulder!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "If we drive out this accursed bird,
the fortress will be ours!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "They want more territory, huh? Don't
give them an inch of Windfall Island!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "They're closing in from three different directions.
We need to divide and conquer to drive them back!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "We'll strike at the monsters in the east
if you can handle the ones in the center!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Hey, look! There's a ship over there!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Look at that fancy cannon...
Ooh, I bet we could use that!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Hold up. That pathway is getting my
treasure sense all twinged.",
  "1.0.12.0" => "The town should be safe, at least
for a little while. Let's keep this up!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "I bet this hammer will be strong
enough to pound switches!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Those foul humans are up to something.
Go find out what!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Sheesh, monsters just keep coming! We
need to bust through that boulder!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Good! The bird has flown the coop!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Oh no! There's a huge bird causing
trouble on Windfall Island!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "That's the Helmaroc King. It carries
people off! It'll take the town keep!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Curse that bird! It's flying too fast
to catch it!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Okay, then let's first beat the boss
in the Forsaken Fortress!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Sure, sure. At least we can
provide SOME attack.",
  "1.0.22.0" => "More weird boulders! Hey, let's
bust 'em up, Link!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "We did it! Our path is clear!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "By taking keeps at the Forsaken Fortress
entrance, we'll suppress reinforcements.",
  "1.0.25.0" => "There are still monsters coming! We need
to get all the keeps at the entrance!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Good, we shouldn't be seeing any more
reinforcements from the fortress.",
  "1.0.27.0" => "It's just a little farther till we get to
the monster's chief.",
  "1.0.28.0" => "No, our territory must grow!
Attack those intruders! Now!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Oh no! It's headed for the town!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "We have to protect the town!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "I can't believe that bird is still flapping
around. We need to put an end to it!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Still fleeing? I won't let you!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Huh? Where's Tetra? Wasn't she going
after that great bird?",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Beaten? How?! Fools! Fight
back against the humans!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "We have to take care of that boss!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "We can't stop the creature! If we don't
do something, then the town is done for!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "We defeated the monster chief! Now we
just need to take care of that creature!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "The horde of monsters is retreating!
We've won!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "But where's Tetra? Why isn't she here?",
  "1.0.40.0" => "They took our base... How will we
press on now...?",
  "1.0.41.0" => "No! It's the end for me...",
  "1.0.42.0" => "More and more monsters coming from
the Forsaken Fortress!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "We need to stop the enemy reinforcements;
otherwise the town is in trouble.",
  "1.0.44.0" => "The monsters beat our allies on the
eastern path. We must protect the town!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Yes! Windfall Island is safe!
",
  "1.0.46.0" => "That huge bird... Where'd it go...
Can't be far...",
  "1.0.47.0" => "It flew away again! Gah, fine. The
town's the bigger priority anyway.",
  "1.0.48.0" => "If you hammer that switch near the ship,
we should be able to fire the cannon!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Never you fear. We're pros. We're going
to launch it good!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "We've got to work together.
C'mon, cooperation is key here!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "We've got monsters coming from the
east! Hurry and drive them off!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "This place was the hideout of small-time
pirates. It seems pretty dangerous now.",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Enemies got into our base! We should fall
back at once!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "If you trust in your strength...come
at me!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "The monsters that just appeared seem
strong. We can't let them reach the town!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "All right, you fools! Keep up the offensive,
and take those humans' keeps!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Yes! Victory's ours!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Quickly, take back the Central Keep!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Take back the East Field Keep at once!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Everyone, look out! Enemies are
attacking from the north!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Oh no! The enemy is coming
through the Central Keep!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "No! The enemy is coming through
the Eastern Keep!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Don't worry, Princess Zelda.
We'll take care of the rest!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Is that a ghost? What is that?",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Don't let that dragon knight
break through!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Princess Zelda!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Come, we must push the enemy back!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Lady Impa, are you OK?",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Are you a soldier in training?",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Princess Zelda, capture the Central and
East Field Keeps to seal the northern gates!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "I'll ready the rope while you command
the assault, Princess.",
  "13.0.16.0" => "The enemy are trapped in the north! With
the Great Fairy's help, they are done for!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Use those bombs to destroy the
wall blocking the Fairy Fountain!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "This way, quickly! We must get to
the Fairy Fountain immediately!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Everyone, be careful! The enemy
is closing in from the north!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "The enemy has broken through
the East Field Keep!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Hurry! We must summon the
Great Fairy right away!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Princess Zelda, your strategy was a success!
The enemy's numbers have greatly diminished!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Princess Zelda, your strategy worked!
The enemy is weakened!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Allow me to handle this, Impa. I need you
to lead the Hylian soldiers in the back.",
  "13.0.26.0" => "Understood. Be safe, Princes!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Well done, everyone. I appreciate
all of your efforts!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "Princess Zelda! The wizard has taken
control of Hyrule Castle!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We have to do something!
Hurry, Link!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "Use those to destroy the boulders
keeping us from reaching Impa.",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Princess Zelda! Use this! It should
increase the power of your bombs.",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Princess Zelda... Forgive me,
but I cannot go on...",
  "13.0.33.0" => "We can't get to Lady Impa with
all these boulders in the way!",
  "13.0.34.0" => "Link, look! There's the princess!",
}